在Spark大數據分析平台上執行下列的Python程式碼:file=spark.textFile(“hdfs://...”) 
//opens a file
counts=file.flatMap(lambda line: line.split(“ “)) 
//iterate over the lines, split each line by space into words
.map(lambda word: (word, 1)) 
//for each word, create the tuple (word, 1)
.reduceByKey(lambda a, b: a+b) 
//go over the tuples “by key” (first element)and sum the second elements
counts.saveAsTextFile(“hdfs://...”)
當輸入短文: a spark can start a fire that burns the entire prairie請問最後存入到 HDFS 檔案的(key, value)一共有多少對?
